@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Device connection test: denied without RBAC principal
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "host": "192.0.2.10",
  "port": 8728,
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "",
  "useTls": false,
  "loginMode": "auto",
  "timeoutMs": 1000
}

### Device connection test: allowed with device:connect
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/test
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: device:connect

{
  "host": "192.0.2.10",
  "port": 8728,
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "",
  "useTls": false,
  "loginMode": "auto",
  "timeoutMs": 1000
}

### Device connection test: allowed with device:test
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/test
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: device:test

{
  "host": "192.0.2.10",
  "port": 8728,
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "",
  "useTls": false,
  "loginMode": "auto",
  "timeoutMs": 1000
}

### Device connection test: allowed with device:manage fallback
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices/test
Content-Type: application/json
x-rbac-permissions: device:manage

{
  "host": "192.0.2.10",
  "port": 8728,
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "",
  "useTls": false,
  "loginMode": "auto",
  "timeoutMs": 1000
}

### Device list remains readable
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/devices
